      "short_id": "c2",
      "expert_id": "expert_a",
      "round_idx": 0,
      "text": "The shape of the mass is oval, which is consistent with benign breast lesions.",
      "label": "BENIGN",
      "addressed": [],
      "provenance": [
        "d_007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f33cd721-473c-4af8-99a1-6e07ffe291ce",
      "short_id": "c3",
      "expert_id": "expert_a",
      "round_idx": 0,
      "text": "The orientation of the mass is parallel, which is a common feature of benign masses.",
      "label": "BENIGN",
      "addressed": [],
      "provenance": [
        "d_007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b3e75ac2-2f1c-45be-9aac-b7a299c118c8",
      "short_id": "c4",
      "expert_id": "expert_a",
      "round_idx": 0,
      "text": "The margin of the mass is circumscribed, indicating a benign nature.",
      "label": "BENIGN",
      "addressed": [],
      "provenance": [
        "t_017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "76ecede1-1a31-4175-83a7-fb05df28139b",
      "short_id": "c5",
      "expert_id": "expert_a",
      "round_idx": 0,
      "text": "The tissue pattern in the background is homogenous, suggesting fat or fibroglandular tissue, which is not associated with malignancy.",
      "label": "BENIGN",
      "addressed": [],
      "provenance": [
        "t_002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2b239d15-4d82-47df-bd72-0bb2eda20fce",
      "short_id": "c6",
      "expert_id": "expert_a",
      "round_idx": 0,
      "text": "The echogenicity of the mass is hypoechoic, which is commonly seen in benign cysts or fibroadenomas.",
      "label": "BENIGN",
      "addressed": [],
      "provenance": [
        "t_028"
      ]
    },
    {
